commits.message:
docs(agents): adopt the naming and versioning policy

Record the rules the rename applied so they outlive it:

- names carry no version; wire, storage, and manifest values do;
- the seam appears when a second version ships, on both sides;
- production is the default, so the exception carries the marker
  (`authenticated-`, `demo-`, `bench-`, `emulator-`, `test-`);
- ticket and goal identifiers live in doc comments, never in names;
- evidence artifacts and plan documents keep the names their verifiers pin.

AGENTS.md carries the one-line always-on rule and points here;
`docs/agents/README.md` lists the file.
